WEBVTT

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:11.440
I see, I see.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.510
Found ya!

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:15.260
Tabane.

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:15.870
Yeah?

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.460
The bread is ready.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:18.990
Okie dokie!

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.670
Ready or not, here I come!

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:33.680
Ooh, that smells scrum-diddly-umptious!

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:39.800
So Chloe, I was wondering if you could do me a teensy-weensy little favor.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.430
Yes. Whatever you need.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.400
C'mon, you don't need to be so stiff and formal!

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.810
You can even call me Mama if you want!

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.460
Forgive me.

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:51.110
Anyway, about the favor...

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.490
Ooh! I'll be taking this!

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:02.250
So yummy!

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:05.580
Anyway, I need you to make a special delivery for me.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:08.210
All right...

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.800
This is so boring.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:23.980
It's because Ichika isn't here, isn't it?

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:25.270
Wh-What?

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.190
N-No it isn't!

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:30.230
Like I care if he's here or not.

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:32.480
If you say so.

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:38.490
Anyway, our personal units are all in repair thanks to that unmanned unit.

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:43.550
And we can't temporarily use other IS units,
since we're locked to our own.

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:47.750
Ichika's unit is out for maintenance, too.

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:49.910
Jeez.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.250
He better come back soon.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:06.860
Wh-What?!

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.870
It's not like I'm lonely or anything!

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:22.490
Hey, Charlotte.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:27.080
Yeah... The emergency power and lights aren't turning on.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.250
Something's up.

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:34.380
All of you with personal units, gather at the underground special block immediately.

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:36.130
I'll send you directions.

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:12.120
Kuramochi Research...

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:16.270
Guess this is the place.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:28.750
Excuse me...

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:41.670
Hey there, pretty boy!

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:43.800
Wanna go in my room and have some fun?

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:51.020
You're Orimura, right?

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.860
Huh? Um, yeah...

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:55.310
I'm Kagaribi Hikaruno.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:00.070
I'm the head of Kuramochi's second lab.

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:01.390
Huh?

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:10.160
Looks like it's been through hell and back.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:13.620
It'll probably be faster if we just do the maintenance here.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:15.830
Will it take long?

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:18.050
Of course it will!

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:20.760
Just go fishing or something.

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:22.920
You can catch loads at the river nearby.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.050
Huh?

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:26.710
You can dig up some bait there yourself.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:28.760
Okay...

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:35.230
There was a place like this underground?

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.650
Let me explain the situation.

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:43.480
At this moment, all of the academy's systems are down.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:47.030
In other words, we're being hacked.

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:50.680
None of the students have been harmed yet,

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:53.950
but we have to regain control of the system, no matter what.

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:59.830
You'll need to dive into system's virtual reality via the IS Core Network.

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:01.860
D-Dive into the system?

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:02.870
Is that...

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:04.210
Don't tell me...

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:09.220
So we'll have to bypass the IS' pilot nervous system protection

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:12.440
and infiltrate the network as our virtual selves?

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:15.180
I know it's theoretically possible, but...

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:19.080
All personnel, stand by!

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:20.440
The mission will now commence.

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:21.700
Roger!

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:24.440
Provide external backup, Sarashiki Kanzashi.

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:25.320
Roger.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:39.750
We will now connect you to the virtual reality.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:43.500
Please head to the system's core and reboot it.

00:06:44.060 --> 00:06:45.330
Get ready.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:03.040
Now then...

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:05.210
I have another task for you.

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:07.490
Your orders?

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:11.610
There's a high chance enemy forces are on their way here.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.990
You want me to intercept them?

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:15.030
Precisely.

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.700
The others can't fight right now.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:19.250
I'm sorry, but I'm leaving it up to you.

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:20.750
Understood.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.050
What is this?

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:40.390
Are we supposed to go in?

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:42.730
Most likely.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:47.440
The signal's unstable up ahead,
so you'll all be on your own.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.710
Roger that.

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:04.960
World Purge. Commence.

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:11.470
This is so relaxing.

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:15.470
The academy's always so loud.

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:19.850
Can't keep up with the energy of teenage girls?

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:21.730
Hikaruno?

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.900
Have you heard of the IS Core Network?

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.770
U-Um...

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:31.690
I-It's based on the communications protocol that they use for space missions.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.950
It's a virtual reality where every IS is connected, right?

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:38.200
Yeah, more or less.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:43.520
That's how your Byakushiki gets data from things like your sister's Kurezakura

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:45.960
and its One Off Ability,

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:51.190
or how it replicates the Shirokishi's abilities.

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:59.430
My job is to augment IS units that gain new abilities and such.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:15.200
What?

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.320
What's going on?

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.160
This is my middle school uniform!

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:24.830
It's gone!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:27.920
This is definitely a trap.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.370
'Sup, Ling.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:34.050
I-Ichika?!

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:40.550
Wh-What is it?

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:43.160
Can I come over to your place?

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:45.430
You know, since we're dating and all.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:54.190
It's okay, right, Ling?

00:09:58.620 --> 00:09:59.450
Yeah...

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:04.040
World Purge. Complete.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.140
Man, it started pouring out of nowhere.

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:28.640
For real!

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:31.270
Jeez, I'm soaked to the bone!

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:39.570
Let me dry you off.

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:42.090
Huh? Oh...

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:44.540
Thanks...

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:50.540
Hey, Ling.

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:53.590
I'll get the rest of your body.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.210
You idiot!

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:06.510
I-I guess it's okay...

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.320
For now.

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:11.310
Wanna take a shower together?

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:12.730
You perv!

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:21.450
Anyway, I need to get changed!

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:31.290
I'm done with the shower.

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:41.130
I want you.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:50.090
No...

00:11:58.920 --> 00:11:59.670
Ling...

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:07.370
You're so pretty.

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:19.170
I-Ichika...

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:21.420
I'm going to take your clothes off.

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:38.690
It's about time.

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:50.200
Didn't take you long to show up.

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:53.750
I wonder, have you been monitoring us 24/7?

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:02.840
Joke's on you. This is an active inertia canceler.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:05.760
And boom goes the dynamite.

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:16.190
So, how did you like my Clear Passion?

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.820
I <i>love</i> things like this.

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:21.910
I understand.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:24.460
If that is the case,

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:29.440
it would be a necessity to have the groups contact each other more frequently, would it not?

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:30.580
I am terribly sorry.

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:33.300
I shall report to you again on a later date.

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:34.110
Farewell.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.220
Did you call, Representative?

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:58.850
You know what to do when we're alone, don't you?

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:03.610
I'm sorry, Cecilia.

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:08.200
<i>The Orimura family has been serving the Alcott family for generations,</i>

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.450
<i>so we've been together since forever!</i>

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:14.290
<i>Since... forever?</i>

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:17.620
<i>Right...</i>

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:22.130
<i>Everything is so perfect...
It's like I'm in a completely different world.</i>

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:24.630
<i>I want this to last forever.</i>

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:27.010
<i>Forever and ever.</i>

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:32.550
Now then.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:43.670
<i>It's the special day of the week.</i>

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.720
Cecilia, I'm coming in.

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:02.580
A-All right. Please do.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:07.840
<i>Today's the day where I have Ichika wash my body.</i>

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:10.320
Shall we start?

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:11.750
Y-Yes...

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:19.180
Please go ahead.

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:22.190
We'll start from the top like always.

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:35.390
<i>It's embarrassing,</i>

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:38.290
<i>but it feels good!</i>

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:47.550
Cecilia, did your rear get a bit bigger?

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:50.380
That's not true!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:52.890
How do you explain all this plump meat then?

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:56.390
Your body has become so lewd.

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:01.950
My lewd Cecilia...

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:06.770
I-Ichika...

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:10.570
Shall I move onto your front side?

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:23.420
It's been a while since I've done my hair like this.

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:31.530
Let's go.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.160
Hey!

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:02.000
You're wearing some naughty underwear again, Charlotte.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.600
Th-This is...

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:06.460
I mean, you're the one who told me to wear it...

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:07.750
Master.

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:12.360
In a week you'll be calling me your husband, not master.

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:16.510
W-Well, for now I'm still your maid...

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:20.390
Are your master's orders absolute?

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:22.520
Yes, of course!

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:28.310
I caught myself a cute maid!

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:43.580
<i>Does this mean it's finally time for... </i>that<i>?</i>

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:47.270
Charlotte.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:02.260
This is...

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:03.380
Yep.

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:05.600
Would you mind trying it on for me, Charlotte?

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.600
O-Of course!

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:11.620
I'll, uh...

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:14.110
I-I'll change into it right now.

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:20.900
I-I've got to do my best.

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:23.870
It'll be every night once we get married.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:26.000
We can do it every night?

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:28.350
D-Did I say that out loud?

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:29.230
Yep!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:33.410
Oh?

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:56.630
Jeez, you guys are so inelegant.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:14.960
Have at you!

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:25.100
The Brunhilde?

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:33.240
What's wrong? Don't just idle.

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:37.230
The one standing before you is the first Brunhilde.

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:40.200
Come at me with everything you've got...

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:42.030
Soldier.

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:48.800
Laura!

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:49.660
It's done!

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:52.730
Here you go.

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:57.030
Sorry for making you do this all the time.

00:19:58.020 --> 00:19:59.300
You're the perfect wife.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:02.180
You have the day off, right?

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:04.800
In that case, I'd like to use one of these.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.180
Th-That's...

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:12.850
Wh-What do you plan on asking me to do?

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:15.990
Let's see...

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:19.190
I want to see you in nothing but an apron!

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:22.360
Y-You fool!

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:24.450
Who in their right mind would do anything like—

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:31.710
Pretty please, Laura?

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:35.290
F-Fine...

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:40.670
A-Are you happy now?

00:20:46.900 --> 00:20:48.310
You're so cute, Laura!

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:50.320
Oh, shut up, shut up!

00:20:50.320 --> 00:20:51.810
Shut up!

00:20:55.780 --> 00:20:57.610
Is that all of them?

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.940
They're definitely Americans.

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:05.820
There was a gap between them getting here and the system going down, though...

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:09.070
Why wasn't it simultaneous?

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:12.330
Are the hackers a different party?

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:23.600
Ichika...

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:32.930
H-Hey!

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:42.600
Sorry, but I have to go back to the academy. Now.

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:43.280
What?

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.150
Sorry, but I don't have time for doors.

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:55.060
Kids these days.

00:21:55.060 --> 00:21:57.960
Well, I got the data I needed, so I guess it's fine.

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:02.380
We can start the next generation's mass production.

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:20.700
I think that's enough.

00:22:20.700 --> 00:22:24.860
The American special forces must have a lot of spare time on their hands.

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:29.610
Coming all the way to some school on some Far East island...

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:33.310
I'm guessing the unregistered unmanned core isn't all you're after.

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:37.410
What a shame, though.

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:40.420
The Byakushiki isn't here anymore.

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:43.920
You know all that, yet you still challenge me?

00:22:45.220 --> 00:22:49.090
You don't think I can take you on with just this?

00:22:49.880 --> 00:22:51.890
You'd be right if I was some ordinary person.

00:23:02.700 --> 00:23:04.110
Over there?

00:23:09.520 --> 00:23:11.280
Let go of her right now!

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:18.060
Tatenashi...

00:23:18.060 --> 00:23:19.370
Tatenashi!

00:23:22.860 --> 00:23:25.170
Ichika...

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:26.600
Are you okay?

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:28.300
I'll take you to the hospital right now!

00:23:29.040 --> 00:23:31.910
I'm... fine.

00:23:32.600 --> 00:23:33.890
Don't worry about me...

00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:37.890
Head over there. Everyone's in danger.

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:38.770
Now!

00:23:40.820 --> 00:23:41.730
Understood.

00:23:43.880 --> 00:23:46.480
They won't be able to come back like this!

00:23:49.120 --> 00:23:50.330
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:23:54.300 --> 00:23:55.200
Ichika!

00:23:56.800 --> 00:23:57.950
Kanzashi?

00:23:58.440 --> 00:24:03.210
The IS Academy is currently powerless due to a hacking attack.

00:24:03.660 --> 00:24:07.460
Houki and the others went into the system in order to fix it,

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:11.590
but they've also been attacked and are unable to wake up.

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:15.600
Ichika, please rescue everyone in the virtual reality!

00:24:16.140 --> 00:24:18.220
I don't fully get it, but okay.

00:24:18.220 --> 00:24:19.350
Here I go.

00:24:24.150 --> 00:24:26.150
N-No!

00:24:28.270 --> 00:24:30.820
You're so cute, Ling.

00:24:33.600 --> 00:24:34.700
W-Wait!

00:24:34.700 --> 00:24:36.330
I can't.

00:24:40.120 --> 00:24:41.610
Ichika...

00:24:46.750 --> 00:24:49.410
You bastard! What are you doing to Ling?

00:24:51.300 --> 00:24:52.130
Ichika?

00:24:52.740 --> 00:24:57.280
<i>Wait, he's wearing the IS Academy uniform...</i>

00:24:57.280 --> 00:24:59.520
<i>Then the Ichika in front of me...</i>

00:24:59.520 --> 00:25:01.750
<i>Is he my ideal Ichika?</i>

00:25:01.750 --> 00:25:03.640
<i>Am I in my own ideal world?</i>

00:25:04.060 --> 00:25:06.980
World Purge. Anomaly detected.

00:25:07.360 --> 00:25:09.120
Entrance of foreign matter.

00:25:09.120 --> 00:25:10.750
Commencing removal.

00:25:15.610 --> 00:25:16.870
It hurts!

00:25:38.140 --> 00:25:39.370
It's okay now.

00:25:43.940 --> 00:25:45.730
I'm right here.

00:25:47.020 --> 00:25:49.270
I'll protect you, Ling.

00:25:52.520 --> 00:25:53.750
Ichika!

00:26:08.180 --> 00:26:10.630
It wasn't me! I didn't do anything!

00:26:11.500 --> 00:26:12.960
Put them back on.

00:26:13.840 --> 00:26:15.360
I said, put my clothes back on me!

00:26:15.360 --> 00:26:16.050
Huh?!

00:26:16.050 --> 00:26:17.880
You're the one that stripped me!

00:26:17.880 --> 00:26:19.390
I said it wasn't me!

00:26:25.860 --> 00:26:27.640
I'll have to touch your panties, okay?

00:26:32.080 --> 00:26:33.530
What the hell are you doing?

00:26:33.530 --> 00:26:36.190
I'm trying not to look, so give me a break!

00:26:39.480 --> 00:26:41.320
You just need to look, right?

00:26:43.180 --> 00:26:46.080
If it's you, I guess it's okay.

00:26:57.500 --> 00:26:59.140
This is Ling.

00:26:59.140 --> 00:27:00.920
My classmate at the IS Academy.

00:27:00.920 --> 00:27:02.980
My second childhood friend.

00:27:04.940 --> 00:27:06.960
Return for now, Ling.

00:27:06.960 --> 00:27:10.580
We don't know how else the attack might have affected you.

00:27:11.280 --> 00:27:12.250
Roger.

00:27:14.800 --> 00:27:16.730
Thanks, Ichika.

00:27:20.440 --> 00:27:23.000
Go rescue the others, Ichika.

00:27:23.000 --> 00:27:23.740
Roger.

00:27:28.180 --> 00:27:29.470
Cecilia...

00:27:32.800 --> 00:27:34.840
You've grown here as well.

00:27:36.760 --> 00:27:40.340
I'll have to take measurements for your new underwear.

00:27:47.680 --> 00:27:49.060
Just what the hell...

00:27:49.820 --> 00:27:51.390
...do you think you're doing?

00:28:09.160 --> 00:28:10.580
Ichika!

00:28:10.580 --> 00:28:14.130
Y-You saw my...

00:28:14.130 --> 00:28:15.860
m-my naked body, didn't you!

00:28:15.860 --> 00:28:17.420
I didn't! I swear!

00:28:17.420 --> 00:28:18.710
Don't lie to me!

00:28:21.540 --> 00:28:22.220
Whoa, hold on!

00:28:23.540 --> 00:28:25.680
I'm going to die of embarrassment!

00:28:25.680 --> 00:28:27.020
C-Cecilia!

00:28:27.020 --> 00:28:29.030
I don't want to hear it!

00:28:33.680 --> 00:28:34.480
It was pretty!

00:28:35.720 --> 00:28:37.310
It was, you know...

00:28:38.040 --> 00:28:40.580
You have a beautiful body.

00:28:40.580 --> 00:28:42.080
Oh my!

00:28:42.080 --> 00:28:45.470
The most beautiful in the world? Oh my, Ichika.

00:28:48.860 --> 00:28:52.550
Anyway, why am I in all of these?

00:28:53.580 --> 00:28:56.500
They are most likely being shown what their hearts desire.

00:28:56.820 --> 00:29:00.020
An ideal world, where everything is perfect.

00:29:00.020 --> 00:29:03.260
They can't return to our world because they don't want to leave theirs.

00:29:05.280 --> 00:29:07.890
Their true desires, huh?

00:29:19.140 --> 00:29:20.920
Ichika...

00:29:20.920 --> 00:29:22.850
You're staring too much.

00:29:37.640 --> 00:29:39.170
U-Um...

00:29:43.860 --> 00:29:46.880
Seriously, what the hell are you trying to do?!

00:30:06.280 --> 00:30:10.150
Don't look, you lecher!

00:30:11.220 --> 00:30:12.910
My eyes...

00:30:13.300 --> 00:30:16.580
But you're the one who told me to put this on!

00:30:16.580 --> 00:30:18.710
And you're also the one who told me to take it off...

00:30:19.020 --> 00:30:22.960
Like I've been saying, that wasn't me!

00:30:31.600 --> 00:30:32.850
Don't even try!

00:30:36.000 --> 00:30:38.020
That's for me to decide.

00:30:45.480 --> 00:30:49.030
You're relying on your absolute defense, so your reactions are delayed.

00:31:10.940 --> 00:31:13.340
Your physical abilities are to be reckoned with.

00:31:13.340 --> 00:31:13.880
But...

00:31:13.880 --> 00:31:17.310
You're mainly here for the unregistered unmanned—

00:31:20.420 --> 00:31:21.230
It's over!

00:31:29.900 --> 00:31:31.070
That was...

00:31:39.080 --> 00:31:40.460
Obliteration Wave.

00:31:56.160 --> 00:31:57.850
I'm not done yet!

00:31:59.020 --> 00:32:03.600
Well then, since you're already wearing an apron, why don't we start cooking something?

00:32:03.600 --> 00:32:04.910
What?

00:32:11.040 --> 00:32:13.700
Hey! Stop that, you fool!

00:32:17.800 --> 00:32:21.870
Want to spend the entire day making love?

00:32:22.540 --> 00:32:26.630
I... I... I...

00:32:27.400 --> 00:32:29.960
You fiend! What did you do to Laura?!

00:32:39.360 --> 00:32:42.980
She looks just like Sleeping Beauty right now.

00:32:43.860 --> 00:32:45.270
How cute.

00:32:48.020 --> 00:32:49.790
All that leaves is Houki...

00:32:52.600 --> 00:32:54.200
I've sent you some special weapons and armor.

00:32:54.880 --> 00:32:56.040
Prepare yourself.

00:32:56.040 --> 00:32:58.830
Houki's version of you is probably the strongest.

00:32:58.830 --> 00:33:00.590
Huh? Why?

00:33:01.960 --> 00:33:03.330
You thick idiot.

00:33:20.520 --> 00:33:22.060
It's your turn, Maya!

00:33:22.060 --> 00:33:23.020
Roger that!

00:33:28.440 --> 00:33:30.020
Quad Phalanx!

00:33:30.580 --> 00:33:33.150
If you can't stand the heat, get out of the kitchen!

00:34:03.520 --> 00:34:05.180
Thank you very much.

00:34:05.980 --> 00:34:08.060
You've gotten pretty good at this.

00:34:08.460 --> 00:34:10.410
Yeah, you too.

00:34:14.500 --> 00:34:17.160
I-If you don't mind,

00:34:17.160 --> 00:34:20.450
I'd like it if you could marry into the Shinonono family.

00:34:20.450 --> 00:34:22.580
That way, the two of us could...

00:34:23.660 --> 00:34:24.950
Hear ye!

00:34:27.440 --> 00:34:29.620
U-Um...

00:34:29.620 --> 00:34:30.790
I'm here to challenge this dojo!

00:34:31.300 --> 00:34:32.420
What?

00:34:33.140 --> 00:34:34.160
I've heard I'm—

00:34:34.160 --> 00:34:36.840
I mean, I've heard Orimura Ichika is here.

00:34:37.440 --> 00:34:39.050
I wish to duel against him.

00:34:40.740 --> 00:34:41.910
Oh?

00:34:44.900 --> 00:34:46.190
This is perplexing.

00:34:48.980 --> 00:34:52.410
Potency against Shinonono Houki is comparatively low.

00:34:53.660 --> 00:34:54.670
Why?

00:34:59.060 --> 00:34:59.610
One point!

00:35:00.820 --> 00:35:01.870
Once more!

00:35:09.140 --> 00:35:10.290
Dammit!

00:35:11.720 --> 00:35:12.830
Again!

00:35:16.760 --> 00:35:19.030
<i>What's with this guy?</i>

00:35:21.300 --> 00:35:23.630
<i>Does he really think he can
beat Ichika like this?</i>

00:35:24.900 --> 00:35:25.870
<i>Although...</i>

00:35:27.100 --> 00:35:29.640
<i>He continues to face forward even though he keeps losing.</i>

00:35:30.320 --> 00:35:31.790
<i>Who is he?</i>

00:35:43.540 --> 00:35:44.200
Not yet!

00:35:53.120 --> 00:35:54.250
Ichika...

00:36:01.340 --> 00:36:02.220
Houki!

00:36:05.020 --> 00:36:06.210
Everyone...

00:36:15.360 --> 00:36:18.230
So this is the system core...

00:36:33.380 --> 00:36:35.840
It's just as Tabane said.

00:36:37.100 --> 00:36:41.470
The core of Orimura Chifuyu's personal IS, Kurezakura.

00:36:54.670 --> 00:36:56.260
I see.

00:36:56.260 --> 00:36:58.820
So someone attacked us in the virtual reality.

00:36:59.280 --> 00:37:03.070
We managed to come back thanks to Ichika.

00:37:03.580 --> 00:37:07.770
But Ichika himself hasn't woken up yet.

00:37:22.500 --> 00:37:24.010
Is that Laura?

00:37:31.320 --> 00:37:33.510
Pleasure to meet you.

00:37:34.400 --> 00:37:37.520
My name is Chloe Chronicle.

00:37:38.100 --> 00:37:40.860
I have fulfilled my master's request,

00:37:40.860 --> 00:37:44.400
so I shall withdraw for now.

00:37:46.800 --> 00:37:48.170
Wait, hold on!

00:37:52.200 --> 00:37:54.910
What should I do?

00:38:03.660 --> 00:38:05.940
He isn't waking up.

00:38:05.940 --> 00:38:09.080
Is he being attacked like we were?

00:38:09.080 --> 00:38:10.940
I don't think so.

00:38:10.940 --> 00:38:13.300
The system's been released already.

00:38:13.300 --> 00:38:14.850
Then why?

00:38:14.850 --> 00:38:15.730
We have to kiss him.

00:38:16.850 --> 00:38:19.360
Wh-What the hell are you on about?

00:38:19.360 --> 00:38:21.760
Don't you fools know?

00:38:21.760 --> 00:38:25.490
A kiss will awaken a sleeping wife from their slumber.

00:38:25.860 --> 00:38:27.600
That's what the lieutenant told me, at least.

00:38:27.600 --> 00:38:29.490
Seriously, you should fire her already.

00:38:29.490 --> 00:38:31.080
Hold on a second!

00:38:31.080 --> 00:38:33.660
We shouldn't dismiss it without testing it ourselves.

00:38:35.100 --> 00:38:39.180
It's, uh, kind of like CPR, right?

00:38:39.670 --> 00:38:42.140
I-If that's the case, I don't mind...

00:38:42.140 --> 00:38:43.300
No, <i>I</i> should be the one—

00:38:43.300 --> 00:38:44.590
Hold it!

00:38:44.590 --> 00:38:45.800
What do you think you're doing?

00:38:45.800 --> 00:38:46.670
Getting ahead of us?

00:38:47.120 --> 00:38:49.580
No, I'm absolutely not doing it for such reasons.

00:38:49.580 --> 00:38:54.600
After evaluating the situation, I concluded that we wouldn't be arriving to a conclusion anytime soon.

00:38:54.600 --> 00:38:58.260
I originally considered taking a more forceful approach,

00:38:58.260 --> 00:39:01.080
but I didn't want to force my opinions on others, so I took a moral approach—

00:39:01.080 --> 00:39:04.320
So long! And it sounds full of crap too!

00:39:04.320 --> 00:39:06.960
You're going in more circles than Cecilia's drills!

00:39:06.960 --> 00:39:08.320
Indeed!

00:39:08.320 --> 00:39:09.820
Wait, what did you say, Ling?

00:39:09.820 --> 00:39:10.820
B-But!

00:39:11.640 --> 00:39:15.020
I'm the only one who didn't get affected by World Purge.

00:39:15.020 --> 00:39:18.210
I want to do the things Ling did...

00:39:20.100 --> 00:39:21.210
Why are you making such a fuss—

00:39:33.200 --> 00:39:35.210
I dreamt of Ling dying!

00:39:45.920 --> 00:39:47.820
Ichika?

00:39:47.820 --> 00:39:49.400
You saw them, didn't you?

00:39:49.400 --> 00:39:51.290
S-Sorry!

00:39:51.960 --> 00:39:55.500
Um, how are your injuries?

00:39:55.500 --> 00:39:57.700
Wait, why are you in my bed?

00:39:59.800 --> 00:40:01.670
Because I'm a patient.

00:40:01.670 --> 00:40:03.710
That's not the problem!

00:40:05.280 --> 00:40:09.290
I-I want you to do lewd things to me, too.

00:40:11.660 --> 00:40:13.960
Kanzashi told me, you know?

00:40:13.960 --> 00:40:17.460
I heard you did all sorts of lewd things in the virtual reality.

00:40:17.460 --> 00:40:19.100
Without my permission,

00:40:19.100 --> 00:40:20.980
or the student council's.

00:40:20.980 --> 00:40:24.790
It wasn't like that! It was a trap...

00:40:36.280 --> 00:40:37.330
Thanks.

00:40:39.540 --> 00:40:42.490
For coming to save me.

00:40:43.580 --> 00:40:46.340
Don't worry about it.

00:40:46.340 --> 00:40:47.800
It made me happy, okay?

00:40:47.800 --> 00:40:49.800
U-Understood.

00:40:53.420 --> 00:40:54.450
Hey...

00:40:55.320 --> 00:40:56.630
Ichika.

00:40:57.550 --> 00:41:00.600
Remember how I said I was
given the name Tatenashi

00:41:00.600 --> 00:41:04.740
because I'm the heir
of the Sarashiki family?

00:41:04.740 --> 00:41:06.450
Hm? Yeah.

00:41:08.180 --> 00:41:12.270
I'll tell you my real name.

00:41:13.840 --> 00:41:15.950
Sarashiki Katana.

00:41:20.720 --> 00:41:21.450
Huh?

00:41:28.320 --> 00:41:29.970
Mind if I share this table?

00:41:31.920 --> 00:41:34.220
Orimura Chifuyu.

00:41:36.880 --> 00:41:40.100
You took good care of my girls the other day, didn't you?

00:41:40.440 --> 00:41:43.110
What a way to buy time.

00:41:45.340 --> 00:41:48.610
Tell Tabane to stop sticking her nose in things she doesn't need to.

00:41:50.480 --> 00:41:53.770
I know what that program Tabane had you put in the system core is for.

00:41:54.620 --> 00:41:57.360
It's for forcefully extracting the Kagezakura, right?

00:41:59.540 --> 00:42:00.810
Don't even try.

00:42:01.300 --> 00:42:03.400
You will never be able to kill me.

00:42:03.400 --> 00:42:06.000
Not with your combat skills.

00:42:10.380 --> 00:42:12.820
A biological IS, huh?

00:42:12.820 --> 00:42:15.300
They got this far in development?

00:42:17.540 --> 00:42:20.920
In the virtual world, you mess with a person's mind.

00:42:20.920 --> 00:42:25.360
To emulate that in the real world,
you manipulate the molecules around them.

00:42:25.900 --> 00:42:27.050
Quite impressive.

00:42:31.460 --> 00:42:32.690
Shall I gouge your eyes out?

00:42:38.200 --> 00:42:39.580
That's more like it.

00:42:39.580 --> 00:42:40.710
I'll see you later.

00:42:45.800 --> 00:42:47.160
By the way,

00:42:47.160 --> 00:42:49.960
shouldn't you go see your little sister?

00:42:50.360 --> 00:42:53.090
She is not my little sister.

00:42:53.920 --> 00:42:55.910
She is the person I could not become.

00:42:56.860 --> 00:43:00.150
The complete form of Laura Bodewig.

00:43:00.860 --> 00:43:04.850
The entity that I, Chloe Chronicle, am not.

00:43:06.680 --> 00:43:07.550
I see.

00:43:13.320 --> 00:43:16.490
<i>I can't quite lose to you yet,</i>

00:43:17.050 --> 00:43:17.930
<i>Tabane.</i>
